{"4484350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hatarake! - Working Hard! Even though I getting isekai'd!", "steam_appid": 4484350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/a984cc342d7b350f7b18ecdb7083b597.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/a984cc342d7b350f7b18ecdb7083b597.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>                                    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gave his life to his job but got nothing in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworked, exhausted, and forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His story should have ended on a cold city street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a god intervenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“All your hard work will be rewarded.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn in Xelia, a world of magic and monsters, he’s granted a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To build a new life, and finally fight for his own happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/be3b20b2f30febc3185c9f4fb85813b8.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/be3b20b2f30febc3185c9f4fb85813b8.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>Build Your Life From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/95a6059440b7e82e9a5218d90bb36793.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/95a6059440b7e82e9a5218d90bb36793.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/95a6059440b7e82e9a5218d90bb36793.mp4?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant and harvest crops, raise livestock, fish in quiet rivers, mine for rare ores, forage in the wild, or take on part-time jobs around town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer peaceful farm life or chasing profit, there are countless ways to earn a living and grow your dream homestead at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Create the Home You Deserve</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/da671df4a10fec8343fe10eb3c1f3762.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/da671df4a10fec8343fe10eb3c1f3762.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/da671df4a10fec8343fe10eb3c1f3762.mp4?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Turn your hard-earned coin into comfort and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your farm, decorate your house with furniture, and life a wonderful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Life Is More Than Work</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/40ba5c8086d0bf831ce9aa258db10600.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/40ba5c8086d0bf831ce9aa258db10600.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/40ba5c8086d0bf831ce9aa258db10600.mp4?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Slow down and enjoy the simple joys of village life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villager, build friendships, experience heartwarming and hilarious cutscenes, celebrate seasonal festivals, and maybe even find someone special to share your new life with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this time, you’re not just working to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/d686e137aaefd2c1e5aa582a7cfcdb88.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/d686e137aaefd2c1e5aa582a7cfcdb88.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br><br><br>[-]Classic farming games with less stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]Don't like farming? Don't force yourself! There are plenty of ways to earn coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]Fight monster in dungeon with Action RPG battle system! (not mandatory)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]Explore dungeon, solve (fairly easy) puzzle and claim treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]There are different festivals every season so you don't get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]Three potential wives you could marry. (who could even have children)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]Buy empty land, invite (force) people to join and now your empty land is not so empty anymore!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-]No main quest = no restriction! Play however you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/a984cc342d7b350f7b18ecdb7083b597.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/a984cc342d7b350f7b18ecdb7083b597.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>                                    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He gave his life to his job but got nothing in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworked, exhausted, and forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His story should have ended on a cold city street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But a god intervenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“All your hard work will be rewarded.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reborn in Xelia, a world of magic and monsters, he’s granted a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To build a new life, and finally fight for his own happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/be3b20b2f30febc3185c9f4fb85813b8.poster.avif?t=1784253914\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484350/extras/be3b20b2f30febc3185c9f4fb85813b8.webm?t=1784253914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>Build Your Life From Scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\